DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8768::$$$message_0063_0000_0000$$$::"Hey. You're Emiya-senpai from third year, right?"[lr]::
8769::$$$message_0063_0000_0001$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
8770::$$$message_0063_0000_0002$$$::I look back at the voice stopping me.[lr]::
8771::$$$message_0063_0000_0003$$$::There was an underclassman that I've seen from somewhere.::
8772::$$$message_0063_0001_0000$$$::"Wait, you're..."[lr]::
8773::$$$message_0063_0001_0001$$$::"I'm Minori Mitsuzuri, first year. I'm in the kyudo club, so you know me, right?"[lr]::
8774::$$$message_0063_0001_0002$$$::"Oh, Mitsuzuri's little brother. No wonder you looked familiar."::
8775::$$$message_0063_0002_0000$$$::Looking back, I've seen him several times since the spring.[lr]::
8776::$$$message_0063_0002_0001$$$::Apparently his bow skills are quite something, and he has Sakura's stamp of approval.[lr]::
8777::$$$message_0063_0002_0002$$$::The older Mitsuzuri is severely critical, saying that he's all show and no good. But she's strict to those she's closest to, so he actually must be an up-and-coming ace.::
8778::$$$message_0063_0003_0000$$$::"...Can you not call me her little brother? You can just call me Minori, Emiya-senpai."[lr]::
8779::$$$message_0063_0003_0001$$$::"Is Minori fine then?"[lr]::
8780::$$$message_0063_0003_0002$$$::"Yeah. Easier for the both of us that way."[lr]::
8781::$$$message_0063_0003_0003$$$::Is this the way he normally talks, or is the bluntness on purpose for something?[lr]::
8782::$$$message_0063_0003_0004$$$::Either way, it would seem he doesn't have a great impression of me.::
8783::$$$message_0063_0004_0000$$$::"So, is there something I can help you with? You wanted something, right?"[lr]::
8784::$$$message_0063_0004_0001$$$::"I don't have any business with you. It's just that people who don't even do club activities anymore and hang around are an eyesore. Since you used to be in the kyudo club, I figured I would ask you what you were doing."::
8785::$$$message_0063_0005_0000$$$::"I was looking into something. Are you done with practice?"[lr]::
8786::$$$message_0063_0005_0001$$$::"Please don't ask me something you already know. I went to go put my things down at my classroom after the club activities were finished."[lr]::
8787::$$$message_0063_0005_0002$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
8788::$$$message_0063_0005_0003$$$::I see.[lr]::
8789::$$$message_0063_0005_0004$$$::But, this is the third-years' hallway. I don't think there's a single first-year classroom.::
8790::$$$message_0063_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
8791::$$$message_0063_0006_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
8792::$$$message_0063_0006_0002$$$::We both go silent.[lr]::
8793::$$$message_0063_0006_0003$$$::It seems like Minori has something to say, but he doesn't try to say it.[lr]::
8794::$$$message_0063_0006_0004$$$::...That's strange. From talking with him, he seems to be the type to say things without reserve.::
8795::$$$message_0063_0007_0000$$$::"Um, how's the kyudo club? What do you think of the new captain as a member?"[lr]::
8796::$$$message_0063_0007_0001$$$::I ask, wanting to hear the opinion from a first-year member instead of Mitsuzuri or Fuji-nee.[lr]::
8797::$$$message_0063_0007_0002$$$::"Well, I think Captain Matou is doing well.[lr]::
8798::$$$message_0063_0007_0003$$$::It's just hard to produce results because there's a lot of amateurs, including myself, but everyone will approve of her next year."::
8799::$$$message_0063_0008_0000$$$::"I see. I'm worried that Sakura would try to do too much by herself. I'm relieved to hear you say that as a member."[lr]::
8800::$$$message_0063_0008_0001$$$::"...What's it matter to someone who quit? Captain Matou doesn't need your pity. God, you'd think you'd know to lay off."[lr]::
8801::$$$message_0063_0008_0002$$$::"Mrgh."[lr]::
8802::$$$message_0063_0008_0003$$$::Hostile, much?[lr]::
8803::$$$message_0063_0008_0004$$$::Mitsuzuri's little brother doesn't like the fact that I quit midway?::
8804::$$$message_0063_0009_0000$$$::"Hey, is something really so wrong about leaving? You have a problem with it?"[lr]::
8805::$$$message_0063_0009_0001$$$::"I don't have any opinion one way or another. Sure, someone as good as you were must've had their reasons for quitting.[lr]::
8806::$$$message_0063_0009_0002$$$::...I'm able to, um, learn a lot when you visit the archery range. My big sis's mood gets better for the day too, so there's not much wrong with that."::
8807::$$$message_0063_0010_0000$$$::"Huh???"[lr]::
8808::$$$message_0063_0010_0001$$$::I don't get it.[lr]::
8809::$$$message_0063_0010_0002$$$::Then, why is Mitsuzuri's little brother so belligerent?::
8810::$$$message_0063_0011_0000$$$::"Can I leave now if you don't have any business? I kinda have other places I want to go to."[lr]::
8811::$$$message_0063_0011_0001$$$::"Oh... Wait, hold on.[lr]::
8812::$$$message_0063_0011_0002$$$::I don't have any business with you. I don't, but...[lr]::
8813::$$$message_0063_0011_0003$$$::My big sis said that you were more knowledgeable.[lr]::
8814::$$$message_0063_0011_0004$$$::Um, I would like to know the Captain's hobbies or what she likes and stuff."::
8815::$$$message_0063_0012_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
8816::$$$message_0063_0012_0001$$$::It dawns on me. Well, it'd be weird not to figure it out at this point.[lr]::
8817::$$$message_0063_0012_0002$$$::"Hey, I'm asking you. If you don't know, then that's fine."[lr]::
8818::$$$message_0063_0012_0003$$$::"No, I do. But what are you going to do with that information? Our conversation is over if you're going to use it for something stupid, though."::
8819::$$$message_0063_0013_0000$$$::"...I don't have to tell you anything."[lr]::
8820::$$$message_0063_0013_0001$$$::"I also don't have to tell you anything, you know."[lr]::
8821::$$$message_0063_0013_0002$$$::"...Dammit. You're a pain in the ass, just like my big sis said."[lr]::
8822::$$$message_0063_0013_0003$$$::Minori curses at me quietly.[lr]::
8823::$$$message_0063_0013_0004$$$::He's blunt, but it doesn't seem like he's that bad a kid, really. ::
8824::$$$message_0063_0014_0000$$$::"Look, it's something private, okay? I'm not gonna use it for anything bad. I just wanted some ideas for a gift."[lr]::
8825::$$$message_0063_0014_0001$$$::"I see. So, you like Sakura, huh?"[lr]::
8826::$$$message_0063_0014_0002$$$::"N-no, that's not it at all.[lr]::
8827::$$$message_0063_0014_0003$$$::It's just that it's almost time for the fall tournament, right? I just want to do something for Captain, since she seems tired."::
8828::$$$message_0063_0015_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri the Younger has some pretty sweet words.[lr]::
8829::$$$message_0063_0015_0001$$$::Though it was kind of tempered by how much he was blushing, giving me second-hand embarrassment.::
8830::$$$message_0063_0016_0000$$$::"Mhm. I see, I see.[lr]::
8831::$$$message_0063_0016_0001$$$::...So, what do you like about her?"[lr]::
8832::$$$message_0063_0016_0002$$$::"...You don't listen to anything I say, do you?"[lr]::
8833::$$$message_0063_0016_0003$$$::"I am listening. I'm listening, so I want you to tell me."[lr]::
8834::$$$message_0063_0016_0004$$$::"You have no integrity. I don't want to tell you."[lr]::
8835::$$$message_0063_0016_0005$$$::He looks away.[lr]::
8836::$$$message_0063_0016_0006$$$::We both go silent. Again.::
8837::$$$message_0063_0017_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
8838::$$$message_0063_0017_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
8839::$$$message_0063_0017_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
8840::$$$message_0063_0017_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
8841::$$$message_0063_0017_0004$$$::"..."[lr]::
8842::$$$message_0063_0017_0005$$$::"...It's not like there's anything specific. She's pretty."[lr]::
8843::$$$message_0063_0017_0006$$$::It seems like he couldn't bear the silence any longer.[lr]::
8844::$$$message_0063_0017_0007$$$::Yeah. I can see how he'd end up like this, with Mitsuzuri as an older sister teasing him all the time.::
8845::$$$message_0063_0018_0000$$$::"Because she's pretty? That's so generalized. If you go that route, Mitsuzuri is also pretty."[lr]::
8846::$$$message_0063_0018_0001$$$::"Stu[line len=2]Don't compare her to my big sis! First of all, she isn't even a girl!"[lr]::
8847::$$$message_0063_0018_0002$$$::...Wow.[lr]::
8848::$$$message_0063_0018_0003$$$::The kind of bombshell that, had Mitsuzuri been within a kilometer radius, would've sent her flying this way at top speed.::
8849::$$$message_0063_0019_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
8850::$$$message_0063_0019_0001$$$::"Oh, um, that was a figure of speech, so please don't tell my big sis I said that."[lr]::
8851::$$$message_0063_0019_0002$$$::"Yeah, I wouldn't tell her even if you told me to."[lr]::
8852::$$$message_0063_0019_0003$$$::The line of fire would be on me first in that case.[lr]::
8853::$$$message_0063_0019_0004$$$::I don't want to make a friend a convict. Also, my life is important.::
8854::$$$message_0063_0020_0000$$$::"Let's get back on topic, Minori.[lr]::
8855::$$$message_0063_0020_0001$$$::So, what do you like about the captain?"[lr]::
8856::$$$message_0063_0020_0002$$$::"...[wvl canskip=0 time=1000]Um, like how she's mature."[lr]::
8857::$$$message_0063_0020_0003$$$::"Hm, hm. What else?"[lr]::
8858::$$$message_0063_0020_0004$$$::"...How sometimes she blushes from spilling tea when no one's looking. It's rare, but I think her soft expression when she has fun is attractive."::
8859::$$$message_0063_0021_0000$$$::"Hm, hm... I guess it's my turn.[lr]::
8860::$$$message_0063_0021_0001$$$::Sakura's hobby is just cooking at the moment, she likes obanyaki from Edomaeya, and what she wants are casual clothes... I think?"[lr]::
8861::$$$message_0063_0021_0002$$$::I'm not so confident on the last one, but I think she was telling Rider that.::
8862::$$$message_0063_0022_0000$$$::"...Hey. Are you fine telling me all this?"[lr]::
8863::$$$message_0063_0022_0001$$$::"Well, what else is there to do? You answered my questions, so I figured I should answer yours."[lr]::
8864::$$$message_0063_0022_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
8865::$$$message_0063_0022_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
8866::$$$message_0063_0022_0004$$$::The third glaring contest begins.[lr]::
8867::$$$message_0063_0022_0005$$$::Though I feel like it's unproductive to do this any longer, so I decide to wrap it up.::
8868::$$$message_0063_0023_0000$$$::"See ya. Good luck at the fall tournament."[lr]::
8869::$$$message_0063_0023_0001$$$::"Thanks... [cacheimage storage=三法01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=三法01c(中)]Well, I'll do my best regardless."[lr]::
8870::$$$message_0063_0023_0002$$$::I part with the young Minori.[lr]::
8871::$$$message_0063_0023_0003$$$::...But, I see.[lr]::
8872::$$$message_0063_0023_0004$$$::I know Sakura is popular among boys, but I didn't think Mitsuzuri's younger brother would be one of them.::
8873::$$$message_0063_0024_0000$$$::"...But, mature, huh...?"[lr]::
8874::$$$message_0063_0024_0001$$$::That's unexpected, or how do I put this?[lr]::
8875::$$$message_0063_0024_0002$$$::Either Minori is unusual, or she seems that way from an underclassman's perspective. Either way, it might mean that Sakura is already an admirable senpai...::
908768::$$$message_9063_0000_0000$$$::"Hey. You're Emiya-senpai from third year, right?"[r]::

